menu "Health Monitor Configuration"

    config HEALTH_PERIOD_MS
        int "Health check period (ms)"
        default 5000
        range 1000 30000
        help
            How often the health task logs heap and per-task stack
            high-water marks to serial. The /health endpoint is served on
            demand and is unaffected by this period.

    config HEALTH_LOG_TO_SERIAL
        bool "Log health data to serial"
        default y
        help
            Useful during development. Turning this off leaves the /health
            endpoint working but silences the periodic log.

endmenu
